    skos:definition '''{"node": {
    "country": "Japan",
    "synonym": "Himawari 7",
    "platformclass": "geostationary orbiting satellite",
    "notes": "Primary client is Ministry of Land, Infrastructure and Transport. MTSAT-2 is a multi-functional satellite with an aviation mission and a meteorological mission. Meteorological mission includes an imager giving nominal hourly full Earth disk images in five spectral bands (one visible, four infrared). Group for High Resolution Sea Surface Temperature (GHRSST) dataset is skin SST calculated from the IR channels of the MTSAT-2 Imager full resolution data in satellite projection on a hourly basis.",
